ditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1、<span style=\"\">加速DMM</span></span><span style=\"\"></span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">打开加速器搜索DMM，启动加速</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"942\" data-height=\"492\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_942/h_492/1164/122379/2022/11/18/496890.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_942/h_492/1164/122379/2022/11/18/496890.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 177.055px; width: 387px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"网页注册\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2、网页注册</span></div></div><ahref=\"https: iknow-pic.cdn.bcebos.com=\"\" c8177f3e6709c93da8b5e02f943df8dcd00054a7\"target=\"_blank\" title=\"点击查看大图\" class=\"ikqb_img_alink\" style=\"margin-left:352.5px;vertical-align:bottom;\"><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">打开DMMGamePlayer</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">点击<img data-width=\"273\" data-height=\"41\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_273/h_41/1164/56174/2022/11/19/366576.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_273/h_41/1164/56174/2022/11/19/366576.png\" style=\"height: 26.8932px; width: 179.086px;\"></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">由于注册需要跳转网页，届时可能会出现一系列问题，请跳转问题解答</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">确定加速是否有效</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">加速器加速一般分为<span style=\"\">局部加速和全局加速；</span></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 局部加速：即只加速DMM客户端，客户端之外的加速不保证</span></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 全局加速：即全体网络皆可访问外网，最直接的体现就是注册网页时不显示地域问题</span></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">确保注册网页跳转时不出现地域问题。（不行<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">多多</span>切换节点或更换加速器）</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">注册账户</span></div></div><br></span></div></ahref=\"https:></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">进入注册页面后，邮箱地址和密码，然后点击送信按钮。</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">然后，就可以去邮箱查收DMM的邮件了。如果在收件箱里找不到的话，可以到垃圾邮件或者广告邮件中找找。打开邮件，然后点击里面的链接。</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">第一次登录还会提示你补充个人信息，玩家只要填上自己的ID，选择性别和出生年月日就可以了。</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">（会出现以下页面，否则会出现用户信息未注册/未登录等问题）</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1346\" data-height=\"661\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1346/h_661/1164/56174/2022/11/19/917111.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1346/h_661/1164/56174/2022/11/19/917111.png\"></div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">也可使用谷歌、FACEBOOK、LINE等登录（但会出现账户密码不正确问题）</div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"登录游戏与链接账号\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">登录游戏</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">搜索游戏</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"margin:17px0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">登陆DMM以后搜索<span style=\"\">デスティニーチャイルド，添加即可<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"263\" data-height=\"269\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_263/h_269/1164/122379/2022/11/18/694459.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_263/h_269/1164/122379/2022/11/18/694459.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">下载游戏</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">正常下载即可；点击进入游戏后不需要加速（觉得下载游戏速度慢的可取消加速）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">连接账号</span></div></div><br></div></span><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">想要互通联动的需要登陆DMM和手机端2边一个是手机端上面的ID。OTP码</div><div class=\"div-img\">点圈的地方输入联动成功就正常继承手机端了，据说DMM的不能转手机具体没试过。<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"444\" data-height=\"812\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_444/h_812/1164/122379/2022/11/18/166880.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_444/h_812/1164/122379/2022/11/18/166880.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"580\" data-height=\"1032\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_1032/1164/122379/2022/11/18/788897.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_1032/1164/122379/2022/11/18/788897.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"问题解答\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">问题解答</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div data-col=\"10\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap auto-size-table\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"173683\" data-insertcount=\"0\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 620px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">问题1</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">地域问题</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">解答1</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">网络加速问题，多尝试切换节点（确保是全局加速）或更换加速器</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">问题2</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">登录后发现用户信息未注册、用户信息未登录</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">解答2</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">邮箱点击时出现的网络问题，DMM客户端点击右上角，直至出现用户信息登录页面（上面有图），出现地域问题1往上看</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">问题3</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">登录时账号密码错误</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39.9844px;\"><td class=\"selected\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">解答3</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"9\" row